57190/extras/5306fc02676cf6c1e32b62d7de26ed11.webm?t=1784073742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legionaries are basic cubes. Their strength is in their numbers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557190/extras/f46a67629d6aa85427a4e5f33ff0cc35.poster.avif?t=1784073742\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557190/extras/f46a67629d6aa85427a4e5f33ff0cc35.webm?t=1784073742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barbarians are fast and brutal units with enough health to counter almost any other cube as long as it is not armored.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557190/extras/0bf1fc62d773e8150100d87862ed8c5a.poster.avif?t=1784073742\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557190/extras/0bf1fc62d773e8150100d87862ed8c5a.webm?t=1784073742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knights are the backbone of every army. They fight with great success against all others except Mages.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557190/extras/30772b82955819ae71d7790204221387.poster.avif?t=1784073742\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat